      - url: "{{ _.baseURL }}/payments/order/65de73a69ca05739be2b5e85"
        name: Get the payment behind an order
        meta:
          id: req_54e5c3a0cf8e25a048fca4c41864479e
          created: 1767225600000
          modified: 1767225600000
          isPrivate: false
          description: The payment record for one of the caller's orders, so a reload mid-flow finds the intent and its status again. Admins read anyone's. No intent yet is a 404 — absence is an answer, the client starts the flow with `POST /payments/intent`.
